    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91395" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πύθων</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωνος</span>, ὁ</span>,
